msgid "Android in-app purchases"
msgstr "Achats intégrés à l’application Android"

msgid ""
"Godot offers a first-party ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` Android plugin "
"compatible with Godot 4.2+ which uses the `Google Play Billing library "
"<https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing>`_."
msgstr ""
"Godot propose un plugin Android ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` compatible avec "
"Godot 4.2+ qui utilise la bibliothèque `Google Play Billing <https://"
"developer.android.com/google/play/billing>`_."

msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilisation"

msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Pour commencer"

msgid ""
"Make sure you have enabled and successfully set up :ref:`Android Gradle "
"Builds <doc_android_gradle_build>`. Follow the installation instructions on "
"the ``GodotGooglePlayBilling`` `github page <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-google-play-billing>`__."
msgstr ""
"Assurez-vous que vous avez activé et configuré avec succès "
"les :ref:`Compilations Gradle Android <doc_android_gradle_build>`. Suivez "
"les instructions de compilation sur la `page github <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`__ de ``GodotGooglePlayBilling``."

